{"id":"rock-salt","name":{"en":"Rock Salt","ja":"岩塩"},"desc":{"en":"Salt that's been hardened like a rock. It doesn't dissolve easily, so it's hard to use as a seasoning. Sometimes these become as beautiful as gems.","ja":"岩のように凝り固まった塩。舐めるとちゃん と塩の味がするが、溶けにくいので料理には 使いづらい。中には、とても塩とは思えない、 宝石のようにきれいな岩塩も存在する。"},"level":1,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-area","name":{"en":"Alanya Area","ja":"アランヤ周辺地域"}},{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}}],"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"seasoning","name":{"en":"(Seasoning)","ja":"（調味料）"},"icon":"totori-category-seasoning"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":23}